    "long_instructions": "# Your app: use the model\nYour model learned from every row of your data. Now let it decide.\n\n1. Take your rule out of **when Check It! clicked**. Put in **predict**, and show the prediction.\n2. Test the same six pictures. Compare the model's answers with your rule's answers.\n3. **Combine them.** Some decisions are best made with a rule first. Put a rule in the **if**, and the model in the **else**.\n\nWhich way worked best for your app: your rules, the model, or both together? Why? Ask a classmate who chose a different app what they found.",
